{"id":668,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"文武両道と豊富な授業で学力を伸ばす","feature_description":"文武両道の伝統を受け継ぎ、6年間の中高一貫教育で真の学力と豊かな人間性、国際性を育てます。豊富な授業時数やキャリア教育プロジェクト、特色ある学習活動を通して、確かな学力と健全な心身を磨く学校です。学習量と活動量の両方を確保しながら、進路にも実践にもつなげます。継続的な積み上げで力を伸ばす設計です。学びの幅を広げる仕組みが整っています。","clubs":[{"id":12571,"name":"吹奏楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://edu.kagoshima-u.ac.jp/jhschool/introduction/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":12572,"name":"合唱部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://edu.kagoshima-u.ac.jp/jhschool/introduction/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":12573,"name":"サイエンス部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://edu.kagoshima-u.ac.jp/jhschool/introduction/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":12574,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://edu.kagoshima-u.ac.jp/jhschool/introduction/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":12575,"name":"書道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://edu.kagoshima-u.ac.jp/jhschool/introduction/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":12576,"name":"放送部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://edu.kagoshima-u.ac.jp/jhschool/introduction/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":12577,"name":"演劇部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://edu.kagoshima-u.ac.jp/jhschool/introduction/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":12578,"name":"華道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://edu.kagoshima-u.ac.jp/jhschool/introduction/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":12579,"name":"茶道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://edu.kagoshima-u.ac.jp/jhschool/introduction/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":12580,"name":"野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://edu.kagoshima-u.ac.jp/jhschool/introduction/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":12581,"name":"ラグビー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://edu.kagoshima-u.ac.jp/jhschool/introduction/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":12582,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://edu.kagoshima-u.ac.jp/jhschool/introduction/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":12583,"name":"バドミ